# Skillforge pre-push gate.
#
# Runs the same three checks CI runs on every PR — lint, build, visual
# regression — before letting a push leave your machine. Catching a
# failure here is ~10x faster than catching it after CI starts.
#
# Timing budget (M-class laptop, warm caches): ~2-3 minutes.
#   - lint:        ~5s
#   - build:       ~30-45s
#   - test:visual: ~60-90s (27 screenshots × Chromium render, sequential)
#
# Emergency bypass: `git push --no-verify`. Use sparingly — if you skip
# the gate locally, CI will catch it and you'll wait longer on the round
# trip than you would have here.
#
# To update visual baselines after intentional UI changes, run
# `npm run test:visual:update` and commit the new PNGs *before* pushing.
npm run verify
